# Design authority

When editing `Design/`:

- Write as a game designer: player fantasy, loops, constraints, open questions.
- Keep pillars coherent with `Design/Pillars.md`.
- New durable choices → `Design/Decisions/YYYYMMDD_short-title.md` using the Decision template.
- Mark unresolved design as open questions; don’t pretend implementation exists.
- Glossary terms go in `Design/Glossary.md` when introducing durable vocabulary.
- Do not invent binary Unreal assets to “match” a doc.
